{"body": [{"y0": 66.0, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 394.8, "text": "Exempla: [1] recitàv|erat; [2] parulerat; [3] scrips|erat; [4]"}, {"y0": 80.2, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 190.9, "text": "dormiv|erat."}, {"y0": 94.8, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 413.9, "text": "Heri magister puerum laudavit, quia bonus discipulus fue- 130"}, {"y0": 108.8, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 395.4, "text": "rat: bene recitáverat et scripserat, magistro pàáruerat, nec in"}, {"y0": 122.9, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 210.0, "text": "lüdo dormiverat."}, {"y0": 136.7, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 395.4, "text": "Bonus discipulus malo: *Heri magister mé laudavit, quia"}, {"y0": 150.8, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 395.0, "text": "bonus discipulus fueram: bene recitaveram et scripseram, ma-"}, {"y0": 164.6, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 414.3, "text": "gistró parueram, nec in lüdo dormiveram. At té verberavit 135"}, {"y0": 178.5, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 395.4, "text": "magister, quia malus discipulus fueràs: male recitàveras et"}, {"y0": 192.5, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 372.0, "text": "scripserás, in lüdo dormiverás, nec magistro pàruerás.\""}, {"y0": 206.4, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 394.8, "text": "Heri magister pueros laudavit, quia boni discipuli fuerant:"}, {"y0": 220.6, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 395.2, "text": "bene recitaverant et scripserant, magistro paruerant, nec in"}, {"y0": 234.6, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 415.4, "text": "lüdo dormiverant. 140"}, {"y0": 248.1, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 395.4, "text": "Boni discipuli malis: *Heri magister nós laudàvit, quia"}, {"y0": 262.2, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 394.7, "text": "boni discipuli fuerámus: bene recitaverdmus et scripseramus,"}, {"y0": 276.0, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 395.0, "text": "magistro pàrueramus, nec in lüdo dormiveramus. At vos ver-"}, {"y0": 290.3, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 395.2, "text": "berávit magister, quia mali discipuli fuerátis: male recitaverà-"}, {"y0": 304.3, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 414.5, "text": "tts et scripserátis, in lüdó dormiverátis, nec magistro pàrue- 145"}, {"y0": 318.2, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 166.1, "text": "rátis.\""}, {"y0": 330.9, "x0": 216.5, "x1